{
  You knew the drill, moving unto the next chamber on your own, there was a prickling feeling.

  But... for some reason, the voice didn't say anything.

  Entering the next chamber, walls... were black, turning back, the previous chamber had vanished.

  Fear washed over you, your body aching, and your throat burning.

  Glancing at your hud, your health was a measly single digit, and memories poured forward, that's right... training compound was destroyed, and you-
}
